meta {
  name: Compare stored records with live DNS
  type: http
  seq: 10
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations/{{organization_id}}/dns-zones/:dnsZone_id/live-mismatch
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  dnsZone_id: 
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  Records whose stored value differs from what public resolvers last answered, each with both values, the likely cause and whether taking the live value is offered. `live_status` says whether that list means anything: `compared` once the records were checked against live DNS, `unanswered` when they were asked about and no resolver could say, `never_checked` before the first check — an empty list then is not a match. Also returns the zone’s delegation state; changes nothing.

  Scope: `dns.read`
}
